OL,3,GNEWSASchool closure plan 'premature',
OL,4,Asays board of governors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposal to close a primary school in
OL,7,Fthe County Londonderry village of
OL,8,FNewbuildings has been branded
OL,9,F"premature" by its board of governors.
OL,11,FThe Council for Catholic Maintained
OL,12,FSchools (CCMS) submitted a proposal to
OL,13,Fclose St Columba's Primary School to
OL,14,Fthe Education Authority (EA) on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,17,FThe proposal would see the school,
OL,18,Fwhich opened in 1955, close on 31
OL,19,FAugust 2027.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
