OL,3,GNEWSASchool closure plan 'premature',
OL,4,Asays board of governors
OL,5,
OL,6,FChair of the school's board of
OL,7,Fgovernors Gareth McFadden said the plan
OL,8,Fwas "disappointing" and the board was
OL,9,F"absolutely committed to the future of
OL,10,FSt Columba's".
